==Battleground==
*5 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**6 [[Chickful A]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**3 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**18 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
**27 [[UltraBaaBaa]]s spawn, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
With the help of meatshields, you can stack up insane amounts of [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance]]/[[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave]]/[[:Category:Surge Attack Cats|Surge]]/[[:Category:Explosion Cats|Explosion]] units onto the first UltraBaaBaa(s) and get yourself a free win.

